<p><strong>Outbound notifications only.</strong> No incoming email or ticket creation. Disabled by default.</p>
<div class="box">
  <p><%= link_to 'Connect Microsoft', microsoft365_smtp_connect_path, method: :post,
                class: 'm365-connect-button', role: 'button' %>
     <%= link_to 'Connection status / disconnect', microsoft365_smtp_connection_path %></p>
  <p>Save settings first, then click Connect Microsoft to open Microsoft sign-in directly. Complete MFA/consent there. This uses the saved mailbox and does not enable delivery or send email.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .m365-connect-button { display: inline-block; background: #0067b8; color: #fff !important; padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none !important; margin-right: 12px; }
  .m365-connect-button:hover, .m365-connect-button:focus { background: #005494; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
<p>
  <label for="settings_enabled">Enable Microsoft 365 SMTP</label>
  <%= hidden_field_tag 'settings[enabled]', '0', id: nil %>
  <%= check_box_tag 'settings[enabled]', '1', @settings['enabled'] == '1', id: 'settings_enabled' %>
</p>
<% [['tenant_id', 'Tenant ID (GUID)'], ['client_id', 'Application / Client ID (GUID)'], ['mailbox', 'Sending mailbox'], ['redirect_uri', 'Registered HTTPS Web callback URI'], ['sender_name', 'Sender display name'], ['helo_domain', 'EHLO domain'], ['open_timeout', 'Connection timeout (seconds)'], ['read_timeout', 'Read timeout (seconds)']].each do |key, title| %>
  <p>
    <%= label_tag "settings_#{key}", title %>
    <%= text_field_tag "settings[#{key}]", @settings[key], id: "settings_#{key}", size: 60 %>
  </p>
<% end %>
<p>The SMTP endpoint is fixed to smtp.office365.com:587, with required STARTTLS and certificate verification.</p>
<p>Configure REDMINE_M365_CLIENT_SECRET_FILE in the Redmine service environment, pointing to a private 0600 file. Alternatively use REDMINE_M365_CLIENT_SECRET. Credentials are never stored in these settings.</p>
<p>Use delegated SMTP.Send and offline_access with browser sign-in + S256 PKCE. SMTP.SendAsApp is not used. SMTP AUTH and tenant sign-in policies must allow this mailbox.</p>
<p>Provision REDMINE_M365_STATE_DIRECTORY as a private 0700 directory outside web-served paths. OAuth grants are encrypted with a key derived from Redmine's secret_key_base. All workers must share the same directory and key.</p>
<p>Save settings while disabled, then <%= link_to 'connect the Microsoft mailbox', microsoft365_smtp_connection_path %>. Changing tenant, client, mailbox or callback URI requires reconnecting.</p>
<p>Save these settings first, then <%= link_to 'open the test-email page', microsoft365_smtp_test_path %>.</p>
